    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 7,
    "title": "State purpose and tightly connected outcomes",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-purpose-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "State purpose and tightly connected outcomes",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "为了 introduces the intended purpose of the following action. It explains what someone hopes to achieve, not proof that the goal has already been achieved. Verb + 了…就… can compress an ordered plan: complete the first action and then do the next. Unlike 为了, it need not state a purpose explicitly.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "为了让大家都能来，我需要再想一下。",
                "pinyin": "wèile ràng dàjiā dōu néng lái ， wǒ xūyào zài xiǎng yīxià 。",
                "meaning": "To make it possible for everyone to come, I need to think again.",
                "audio": "18dde420011c557235988dce41bcb03b080a71ecc2e9e8ccf7e8056c1c9eacea"
              },
              {
                "text": "我买了书就回家。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le shū jiù huí jiā 。",
                "meaning": "I will go home once I have bought the books.",
                "audio": "4ec2edf76afa5d9c3ecf73f12736cee24214a3141e1841157408845045101774"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "为了",
                "pinyin": "wèile",
                "meaning": "in order to",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "945c9a681caa57ed687d7abb35b75b7d274ae579ddffa0007cdcb5e8b247f456"
              },
              {
                "text": "了",
                "pinyin": "le",
                "meaning": "aspect or change-of-situation particle; not a past-tense ending",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "90e3611d8b6518d478d1242948ff62d4fa8f51abdebc5a7fcc8a631a7665ece6"
              },
              {
                "text": "就",
                "pinyin": "jiù",
                "meaning": "then; right away",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "f0e99437a6dd05e9ef5bd2ba16b98e7755d755bff2b6c65215812fd123508721"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
